ll. In many other games this is an upgrade, in which case melee builds that don't receive it become wasted runs.\n\nThere's a lot of depth to uncover here. Each level can have multiple exits, leading to alternate routes - even some secret levels. Moreover, completion speed and collected experience contribute to ranks, which affect your earnings per level. This is great design because it forces you to keep up the pace; the same is true of room-sized arenas the game occasionally locks you into. You are not a sentry and there will be no camping; not unless you'd like to be a shiny corpse, that is.\n\nYou will discover much more on your quest which I don't see fit to spoil. If you're still uncertain, listen to the soundtrack. If you have ears, that will take care of the rest.", "timestamp_created": 1786024494, "timestamp_updated": 1786967111, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "hardware": {"system_ram": "15907", "os": "Artix Linux", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 7 2700X Eight-Core Processor         ", "adapter_description": "AMD AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT (radeonsi, navi22, ACO, DRM 3.64, 7.1.6-artix1-1)", "vram_size": 12288}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232179344", "author": {"steamid": "76561198806453442", "personaname": "Seth is noisage", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198806453442/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1715, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1694, "deck_playtime_at_review": 1668, "last_played": 1786012812, "avatar": "0c39a2279edbe13f82537b1768383d98461c6836"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun Game to play with bro's", "timestamp_created": 1786009699, "timestamp_updated": 1786009699, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, 